# This directory also holds unrelated projects/raw assets alongside the
# actual Next.js app (a separate Remotion video project, asset dumps,
# zips) — excluded so they never end up in this repo's history. Every
# entry is anchored to the repo root (`/`) — unanchored `IMAGES/` also
# matched `public/images/` (case-insensitively) and silently dropped every
# real site photo from the deploy. Root-only, not "anywhere".
/idea-hunter-film/
/hero-film/
/hero film/
/IMAGES/
/LOGOS/
/clips/
/*.zip
/young-businesswoman-boardroom-portrait.png
/ADPRO360_HANDOFF.md
